{
  "info": {
    "name": "Shemford ERP - Daily Collection Report API",
    "description": "Handover collection for the Daily Collection Report API.\n\n1. Import this file and the environment file.\n2. In the environment set `baseUrl` (the ERP server address ending in /api), `loginId` and `password` (an accountant or admin account issued by the school; the password is never stored in this file).\n3. Run `0 - Authentication > Login` once; the access token is stored automatically (valid 15 minutes; run `Refresh token` to renew without a password).\n4. Run the requests in `1 - Pull report`.\n\nThe folder `3 - Push webhook (what we send you)` documents the request OUR system sends to YOUR endpoint every night at 23:59 Asia/Kolkata. It is a reference for building your receiver, not something to call.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// reportDate defaults to yesterday (Asia/Kolkata) when the environment value is empty",
          "if (!pm.variables.get('reportDate')) {",
          "  const d = new Date(Date.now() - 24 * 3600 * 1000);",
          "  pm.variables.set('reportDate', d.toLocaleDateString('en-CA', { timeZone: 'Asia/Kolkata' }));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exchange credentials for an access token (valid 15 minutes) and a refresh token (valid 30 days). 5 failed attempts lock the account for 15 minutes.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{loginId}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"platform\": \"web\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK (token values shortened)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "auth",
                    "login"
                  ],
                  "query": []
                }
              },
              "body": "{\n  \"token\": \"<access-jwt>\",\n  \"refresh_token\": \"<refresh-token>\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"user_id\": \"<id>\",\n    \"email\": \"<loginId>\",\n    \"role\": \"accountant\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Invalid credentials",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "auth",
                    "login"
                  ],
                  "query": []
                }
              },
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"Invalid credentials\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('token returned', () => pm.expect(j.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refreshToken', j.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exchange the refresh token for a new access token. The refresh token rotates: the old one stops working immediately, so always store the new one.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.token || j.access_token);",
                  "if (j.refresh_token) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', j.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 - Pull report (GET)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daily report - summary for one date",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reports/daily-collection?date={{reportDate}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reports",
                "daily-collection"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{reportDate}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Collections for `date`, grouped by payment mode, with refunds and net collection. Roles allowed: admin, accountant."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
